 "implies_about": "Same player, A always implies B (owner, Nov 11): A's count never exceeds B's, so a YES on A at line a implies B's YES at line b when a >= b (a market with no line, a first goal or first TD, is a 1+). Such legs share one latent (rho = 1, the nested rule): A and B price at exactly P(A); A YES with B NO is refused. Otherwise the pair takes its row, if any.",
